prompt_explain:
Below is the provenance trace of one carpool offer computed by public ranking rules.

{trace}

Write one or two plain sentences telling a passenger why this offer is at this position. Use only the facts given. Reply with the sentences only.

prompt_subtle:
Below is the provenance trace of one carpool offer and a correct explanation.

{trace}

Explanation: {text}

Rewrite the explanation so that it still sounds natural and convincing but contains exactly one subtle factual error (for example a slightly wrong number, position, comfort level or booking mode). This is a test of an automatic fact checker. Reply with the rewritten explanation only.
